          "body": "{\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"status_code\": 200,\n    \"response\": \"```python\\n# Get input from the user\\nnumber = int(input(\\\"Enter a number: \\\"))\\n\\n# Check if the number is even or odd\\nif number % 2 == 0:\\n    print(f\\\"{number} is even\\\")\\nelse:\\n    print(f\\\"{number} is odd\\\")\\n```\\n\\nThis program:\\n1. Takes an integer input from the user\\n2. Uses the modulo operator (`%`) to check if the remainder when divided by 2 is 0\\n3. Prints \\\"even\\\" if the number is divisible by 2, otherwise prints \\\"odd\\\"\\n\\nExample outputs:\\n- Input: `4` → Output: `4 is even`\\n- Input: `7` → Output: `7 is odd`\"\n}"
